o<restore_tool_length> sub
; Re-apply G43 for the loaded tool after Stop / Abort.
; on_abort used to issue G49, which made work Z jump by the tool length
; even though G54 was unchanged.
; Skip if no tool or length never measured — G49 remains the interp default.
; Cannot be called from RS274NGC_STARTUP_CODE — O-words are illegal there
; ("Bad character 'o' used on startup").
; Revert: stop calling this from on_abort.ngc; put G49 back after G40.
; See docs/DEVIATIONS.md "Keep G43 on Stop".

o<10> if [#5400 GT 0]
  o<20> if [#5403 GT 0]
    G43 H#5400
  o<20> endif
o<10> endif

o<restore_tool_length> endsub
M2
